  m_text: "In a small place, not so different from here. \nWhere warmth feels familiar
    and hearts are sincere. A gentle soul waits with a comforting glow, she speaks
    not in riddles, yet knows what you should know.\nTurn from her whispers, follow
    the dark, where hot breath lingers and leaves are marked.\nIn a quiet clearing,
    bound by fire, gold rests on a sleeper you should not desire"
